SCOPE

The MIT license above covers ONLY the packaging files authored in this
repository (libxml2.nuspec, libxml2.vcpkg.targets, libxml2.vcxproj,
libxml2.sln, vcpkg.json, vcpkg-configuration.json, the GitHub Actions
workflow, and the documentation).

It does NOT cover, and does NOT relicense, the third-party binaries and headers
redistributed by the published NuGet package. Those keep their own licenses:

    libxml2                    MIT
    zlib                       Zlib
    liblzma (XZ Utils)         0BSD
    GNU libiconv / libcharset  LGPL-2.1-or-later   (dynamically linked)

Verbatim license texts are in licenses/. Attribution and the LGPL relink notice
are in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.
